      "content": "the flight might be cheaper but i'm worried about the hassle of getting to/from the airports. for the shinkansen, is it easy to just show up and buy tickets at the station or should i book ahead? also, do the trains ever have major delays that mess up the schedule? i'm on a pretty tight itinerary.",
